# astrion-skill v1
goal: Increase screen brightness one step
trigger:
  - phrase: "brighter"
  - phrase: "brightness up"
  - phrase: "increase brightness"
do: |
  Raise the display brightness by 10% via the system.setBrightness
  capability. If already at max, show a notification "Already at max
  brightness." Otherwise show the new brightness percentage briefly.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 100
  reversibility: FREE
